# Everything here is excluded from the build context, i.e. never sent to the Docker daemon and
# never copied by `COPY . .` in the builder stage.
#
# This file is a security control, not an optimisation. Without it, `COPY . .` bakes .env.local
# (real Supabase service-role key) and docs/Credentials.md (working admin sign-in credentials)
# into an image layer, where they survive even if a later layer deletes them.

# --- Secrets. The most important lines in this file. -----------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docs/Credentials.md

# --- Local tooling and agent state ------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
.codegraph/
.fallow/
.mcp.json
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Version control and CI -------------------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.github

# --- Build output and caches (rebuilt inside the image; copying them in breaks the build) ------
node_modules
.next
out
build
dist
*.tsbuildinfo
src/lib/generated/prisma

# --- Tests: not needed to build or run the app ------------------------------------------------
e2e
e2e/.auth
playwright.config.ts
playwright-report
test-results
coverage
vitest.config.ts
**/__tests__

# --- Docs and reference material --------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep docs/reference: prisma/import-factors.ts reads the emission-factor workbook from there and
# the migrator image runs that script. docs/sample-data is ~5.5 MB of workbooks nothing needs at
# runtime.
docs/sample-data
docs/superpowers
docs/client-comments
reference/
*.md
!README.md

# --- Misc -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
logs
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
